{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3439,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","line":5957,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[Nondegeneracy of a Hypersurface]\n\\label{prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-riemannian-metric, def:pseudo-normal-space, lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal, lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane, lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.70}\n\nLet $F:M\\to\\widetilde M$ be smooth with $\\dim M+1=\\dim\\widetilde M$ and $dF_x$ injective. The restriction of $\\widetilde g_{F(x)}$ to $dF_x(T_xM)$ is nondegenerate if and only if every nonzero $v\\in N_xM$ is non-null.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal,lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane,lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate}\n\\sketch Apply Lemma \\ref{lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate} to $W=dF_x(T_xM)$; Lemma \\ref{lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane} supplies codimension one and Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal} identifies $W^\\perp=N_xM$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[Nondegeneracy of a Hypersurface] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a70736575646f2d7269656d616e6e69616e2d6879706572737572666163652d6e6f6e646567656e6572617465\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-riemannian-metric\">↗ def:pseudo-riemannian-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-normal-space\">↗ def:pseudo-normal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahyperplane-nondegenerate\">↗ lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.70</span></span><p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F:M\\to \\widetilde M$\">$F:M\\to \\widetilde M$</span> be smooth with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\dim M+1=\\dim \\widetilde M$\">$\\dim M+1=\\dim \\widetilde M$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dF_x$\">$dF_x$</span> injective. The restriction of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\widetilde g_{F(x)}$\">$\\widetilde g_{F(x)}$</span> to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dF_x(T_xM)$\">$dF_x(T_xM)$</span> is nondegenerate if and only if every nonzero <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in N_xM$\">$v\\in N_xM$</span> is non-null.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\">↗ lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\">↗ lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahyperplane-nondegenerate\">↗ lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate</a> \\sketch Apply Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahyperplane-nondegenerate\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6879706572706c616e652d6e6f6e646567656e6572617465\">17</a> to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W=dF_x(T_xM)$\">$W=dF_x(T_xM)$</span>; Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ahypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6879706572737572666163652d74616e67656e742d6879706572706c616e65\">17</a> supplies codimension one and Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d6e6f726d616c2d73706163652d65712d6f7274686f676f6e616c\">17</a> identifies <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W^\\perp =N_xM$\">$W^\\perp =N_xM$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:submanifold-signature-in-ambient-fibre","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","title":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","label":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","title":"def:pseudo-normal-space","label":"def:pseudo-normal-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","title":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal","label":"lem:pseudo-normal-space-eq-orthogonal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","title":"lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane","label":"lem:hypersurface-tangent-hyperplane"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","title":"lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","label":"lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-hypersurface-induced-tensor-nondegenerate","title":"lem:pseudo-hypersurface-induced-tensor-nondegenerate","label":"lem:pseudo-hypersurface-induced-tensor-nondegenerate"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","ti